Feature: Message Parser Hybrid Format Handling
  As a developer
  I want to ensure the MessageParser can parse hybrid format messages
  So that the system can process JSON + metadata correctly

  Scenario: Parse a JSON message with metadata
    Given a hybrid format message with JSON and metadata
    When I parse the message using MessageParser's parse method
    Then the object should have the correct values from JSON content
    And the object should have the correct values from metadata
    
